<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/hot_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: new car, dealerships mark up? &nbsp;(Read 394 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=801" title="View the profile of Diggins">Diggins</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 28<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/Cheschirecat.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=801"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1208.msg11983#msg11983"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1208.msg11983#msg11983">new car, dealerships mark up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> October 24, 2004, 10:58:48 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Admittedly I don&#039;t know much, or as much as I should, about car dealerships and terrible at haggeling, generally if I want something, I don&#039;t want to make it a big hassle, I just grab it.<br /><br />My last new car was offered to me at a price much lower than I expected to pay so I didn&#039;t have to haggle at all.<br /><br />Dealerships are adding $5000.00 on top of the msrp and some even more than that on the car I want.<br /><br />Whats the deal, any insider info or tips, other than waiting a year for the furvor to wear off before making the purchase?
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Diggs
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11985"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146" title="View the profile of simplee">simplee</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 158<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/devil1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								smoked again................    ranger down!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1208.msg11985#msg11985"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1208.msg11985#msg11985">Re: new car, dealerships mark up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> October 24, 2004, 05:29:58 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Go to different dealerships - pit them against each other.<br /><br />Do your research on the web, know what you want, how much any add-ons cost, what the delivery charge is, etc.&nbsp; Be confident.<br /><br />I&#039;m a woman, walked into 4 dealerships when I bought my car.&nbsp; The first one tried to sell me a car in a color that didn&#039;t exist for that model - when I corrected him, he had to go back and check his books... only to find that I was right.&nbsp; His price was about 3k more then any others.&nbsp; The last two dealerships I pitted against each other.&nbsp; Oddly enough, one owned the other.&nbsp; I still got a price I thought to be reasonable.<br /><br />Don&#039;t be afraid to walk away.&nbsp; They may tell you that the offer is only valid until you leave, but that&#039;s BS.&nbsp; If they want the sale, the offer will come again.<br /><br />If they can&#039;t negotiate prices with you, see if they can negotiate financing.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Huntress Simplee Mee<br />70 Plainswalker
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11986"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=49" title="View the profile of Kweil">Kweil</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								The Bard that is no more.<br />
								Moderator<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 889<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								Bard down! Bard Down!!<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=15911991" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=15911991&amp;img=5" alt="15911991" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=mikemillorg"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=mikemillorg&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="mikemillorg" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=mikemillorg&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="mikemillorg" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=49"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.mikemill.org" title="My Web Page" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1208.msg11986#msg11986"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1208.msg11986#msg11986">Re: new car, dealerships mark up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> October 24, 2004, 07:00:15 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							When my mom got her car she talked to one of the fleet managers.&nbsp; Going through them was much cheaper then going through a salesmen.&nbsp; The reason was that the fleet manager&#039;s job was to keep the inventory moving and they don&#039;t get paid on commission.&nbsp; So they did pretty much everything to get her to buy the car.&nbsp; My mom borrowed the money from her mom instead of finacing it and when there was gonna be a few days delay in the change of money they said that they&#039;d accept a post dated check and wouldn&#039;t deposit it till that time, and that if something came up where she needed to push it back a few days they&#039;d do that.<br /><br />I would say the most important thing is to use the internet to do research, get all the quotes you can, and don&#039;t talk to the floor salesmen.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11990"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=745" title="View the profile of Needaa">Needaa</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 40<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=miladymouse"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=miladymouse&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="miladymouse" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=miladymouse&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="miladymouse" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=745"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1208.msg11990#msg11990"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1208.msg11990#msg11990">Re: new car, dealerships mark up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> October 25, 2004, 06:44:40 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Not only should you shop around for the best price, but also check with the Better Business Bureau to see which dealerships are reputable.  Foregoing service for price can be a real bear during a new car&#039;s &quot;breaking in&quot; period.  <br /><br />After doing research, it&#039;s always good to go in with an attitude that says &quot;I&#039;ll buy from you only if you can meet my price&quot;.  Don&#039;t go in looking like Odie all excited with your tongue hanging out when you see the car that you want.  Be indifferent.  Remember, you are the customer and the salesman&#039;s livelihood depends on selling you a car.  If you don&#039;t like the price that is being quoted and he&#039;s hard-selling you even better...tell him that the price quoted is out of your ball park and see if he&#039;ll &quot;work the numbers&quot;.  If he doesn&#039;t, thank him and head for the door.  Many a time I&#039;ve had one foot out the door and got the price I wanted.  <br /><br />Word of warning...watch the 0% down 0% interest for one full year...you can find yourself in a world of hurt when the interest finally kicks in.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Needaa Spiritfyter<br />Guild Leader, Dark Empire
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
