	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11994"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=801" title="View the profile of Diggins">Diggins</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 28<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/Cheschirecat.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=801"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1208.msg11994#msg11994"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1208.msg11994#msg11994">Re: new car, dealerships mark up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> October 25, 2004, 10:13:25 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							well let me make it more specific, I want a 05 mustang gt premium.&nbsp; Because it&#039;s an all new platform and body style it has been much anticipated, EVERY dealer is throwing on an added mark up.&nbsp; I&#039;m just curious if there is a way around that, maybe by ordering one directly from ford.&nbsp; I&#039;m not about to pay 5k just to be the first kid on the block to have one but imagine dealerships will have no motivation to deal since they are already very much in demand.&nbsp; I&#039;ve been in contact with three dealerships close to home all claiming &quot;well our mark up isnt as high as the others&quot; when they are all right around 5k. <br /><br />I think if I wan&#039;t to get any kind of deal at all, I&#039;ll probably have to wait until next year.&nbsp; I&#039;m willing to wait but if I can get one for MSRP or less now, I&#039;m ready to buy.<br /><br />I&#039;ve done my home work, I corrected the sales person already when I was looking at their only example on the lot.&nbsp; Now the keeping a serious demeanor, that was easy when buying my Honda, little harder when looking at this car&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Diggs
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12016"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52" title="View the profile of Gabus">Gabus</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
