							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Drove home in my brand new 2005 mustang GT tonight, fully loaded for MSRP and 4.3 apr.&nbsp; Went through the fleet manager and took a bit of haggling but they must have wanted the sale.<br /><br />What a differance, going from a 127hp civic to a 300hp mustang.&nbsp; This car owns&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br />Just had to brag a bit, think my penis grew like 3 inches :p
